<title>USA: Dignity Partners Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Dignity Partners Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     loss $2.34	     profit $0.13</p>
<p> Net		 loss 10,034	    profit 247</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr primary     loss $2.49	     profit $0.31</p>
<p> Net		 loss 9,547	     profit 594</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q3 and nine months loss includes $300,000 realized loss in connection with the sale of some life insurance policies, a $3.3 million provision for the loss on the sale of assets, and a $6.9 million valuation provision for life insurance policies pledged for the company's viatical settlement notes.</p>
